     The vvggaaffbb is a memory based color frame buffer driver for the wscons(4)
     console framework.  It does not provide direct device driver entry points
     but makes its functions available via the internal wsdisplay(4) inter‐
     face.  Both unaccelerated access as a dumb framebuffer and accelerated
     access methods are provided to wscons(4).

